# DEPRECATED - Retired per Issue #495 / #479

This file has been retired. Satellite registry information is now maintained in the
generated REGISTRY.a2ml (from scripts/build-registry.sh) which provides hash-verified
pointers. See .machine_readable/REGISTRY.a2ml for the authoritative source.

This file is kept for historical reference only and will be removed in a future cleanup.
